    <div class="khas-about-new-hero-content">
      <div class="khas-about-new-crown">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 35" width="120" height="42" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M 40,30 L 60,30 L 62,24 L 56,26 L 50,15 L 44,26 L 38,24 Z" fill="#fabd2f" />
          <circle cx="50" cy="13" r="1.5" fill="#fabd2f" />
          <circle cx="38" cy="22" r="1" fill="#fabd2f" />
          <circle cx="62" cy="22" r="1" fill="#fabd2f" />
          <path d="M 42,28 Q 50,29 58,28" stroke="#fabd2f" stroke-width="1" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h1 class="khas-about-new-hero-heading">About Khas Foods</h1>
      <p class="khas-about-new-hero-subheading">Bringing authentic flavors, trusted quality, and the warmth of every kitchen together—one ingredient at a time.</p>
      <div class="khas-about-new-hero-buttons">
        <a href="/collections/all" class="khas-about-new-btn khas-about-new-btn--primary">Explore Our Products</a>
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="khas-about-new-btn khas-about-new-btn--secondary">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Our Story Section -->
  <div class="khas-about-new-section">
    <div class="khas-about-new-story">
      <div class="khas-about-new-story-content">
        <h2 class="khas-about-new-section-heading">Our Story</h2>
        <div class="khas-about-new-divider"></div>
        
        <div class="khas-about-new-story-block">
          <h3 class="khas-about-new-story-heading">Our Beginning</h3>
          <p class="khas-about-new-story-text">Khas Foods was born from a simple belief: that every meal deserves authentic, high-quality ingredients. What started as a passion for bringing genuine flavors to everyday cooking has grown into a trusted brand serving families across the UK.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="khas-about-new-story-block">
          <h3 class="khas-about-new-story-heading">Our Journey</h3>
          <p class="khas-about-new-story-text">From carefully selecting the finest spices to perfecting our cooking pastes, every step of our journey has been guided by tradition and quality. We've built relationships with trusted suppliers and developed processes that preserve the natural essence of every ingredient.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="khas-about-new-story-block">
          <h3 class="khas-about-new-story-heading">Our Promise</h3>
          <p class="khas-about-new-story-text">We promise to deliver products that you can trust—ingredients that bring authentic taste to your table, packaged with care, and sourced with integrity. Your kitchen deserves nothing less.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
